{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "繼忠"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "仁岳"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "函丈仁岳"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "仁岳"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "仁岳"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "仁岳"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "仁岳"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "下文\n引起信明事業二識云云"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "仁岳"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "即六十萬億那由他由旬，非大論中色像無邊"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "妙樂云：彌陀著弊，諸教無文"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "人間一百年為一日"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "妙宗前文有此一說"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "妙宗引此為證"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "仁\n岳"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "仁岳"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "仁岳"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "仁岳"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "終"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "繼忠"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "文畢"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此文出謗者三身壽量解。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "彼文"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "彼文"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "彼文"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "畢文"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "云\n云"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "云云"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "云云"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "云云"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "云云"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "文畢"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "終"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "繼忠"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "仁岳"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "函丈"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "仁岳"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "解書甚廣，大率不出五義。\n一謂法華開權顯實，即劣應為尊特。二謂彌陀八萬相好，是他受用報身。三謂圓教外凡，依業識見佛。四謂安\n養生身，是丈六像。五謂法身有相。以此五義，翻前十諫，成乎二謗。今略取五義，書之於前。次廣據諸文，雪之於\n後。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "下文云：法華文句摩訶止觀，以三十二相皆稱相海，相既稱海，即是尊特。\n又云：金光明及薩遮經所說佛相，並不現大，皆是尊特。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "大論云：轉\n輪聖王亦有三十二相，故知此身但是示同人中貴極之相耳"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "華嚴、\n方等、般若、法華"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "疏文"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "密迹經云：應持欲量佛身，即自變形高三百三十萬里，復見佛\n身高五百四十三萬兆姟二億里，乃至上方百億？河沙世界，永不得見釋尊之頂"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "大論云：佛念目連，欲試清淨音場，吾今欲現。時目連承佛力，去至西方界分九十九？河沙佛土\n光明王佛所，彼佛告云：仁者不宜試佛聲遠近，假使過於？河沙劫行，亦不能知"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "下文明八\n萬相好，是他受用報身"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "報兼自他，故著等字"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "大論云：法性身\n佛，光明無邊，色像無邊，尊特之身，猶如虛空，為法性身菩薩說法耳。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "下文據起信云：深信\n真如法故，少分而見，知彼色相離於分齊。意謂此是圓人頓伏五住，即依業識得見尊特，不許別圓地住\n已前依事識見佛。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "解書"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "法華文句"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "下文據華嚴有初成正覺之言，定藏塵相好，須是分段生滅之身"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此對凡夫心力謂之無邊，其實\n有邊；亦如無量，其實有量"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "大論中，凡有數處，說三十二相，是生身佛"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "又若云生身即法不即尊，特與而論之；幻有即空，奪而為\n論，外道斷見。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "解書"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "自受用同"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "他受用同"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "仁岳"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "仁岳"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "仁岳"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "終"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "并序"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "仁岳"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "繼忠"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "立指濫"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "立隨\n緣擈"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "立隨緣徵決"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "差別義如第二門辨"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "因字如第三門已破"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "真如生法"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "梨耶生法"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "上皆妙玄之文"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "彼文"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "終"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "讀者應對本文，方彰其義，下去皆爾"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "知禮"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "終"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "繼忠"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "仁岳"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "講次"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "上皆\n釋籤"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "上皆記文"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "即性德三因也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "即修得三因也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "即一乘之旨也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "仁岳"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "終"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "繼忠"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "仁岳"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "講次"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "已上妙樂"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "理也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "心也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "色也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "上皆妙宗。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "上皆注文"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "上皆疏文"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "上皆\n輔行"}
